  "details": "A useful feature would be to have VRChat be able to send MIDI messages back out to the selected MIDI device. This will allow for things like LED feedback and sound feedback when firing MIDI messages into VRChat. Being able to organize a grid based MIDI controller like a Novation Launchpad or an APC40 with their built in LEDs would be extremely useful, especially when they're bound to numerous functions.",
